title: Replacing one match with text that contains the query moves on to the next match, not into the text just written
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\nfoofoo foofoofoo food\n

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
tool edit
edit words.txt 1 1
find foo
wait 300
mark found
wait 400
find replace foofoo
wait 300
mark after-first
wait 400
find replace foofoo
wait 300
mark after-second
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
